{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Keturah.</b> She is not Hagar, for it is written, \"and to the sons of the concubines that were Abraham's, Abraham gave\" (Genesis 25:6), and the meaning of pilagsh is maidservant, and this term does not apply to a male, and we may interpret \"concubines\" as women."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:42.314543539Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}